  {
   "id": "serious-sam-shatterverse-396022@1",
   "gameId": "serious-sam-shatterverse-396022",
   "displayName": "Update 1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-09T17:05:13.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey, Sams! A new Serious Sam: Shatterverse update is available now, bringing a round of fixes, quality of life improvements, and a little extra polish across the Shatterverse.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here’s what’s changed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Gameplay & Quality of Life",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added a blend delay for the SOP38 Pistol when aiming for smoother transitions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Default Camera Smoothing is now off for mouse & keyboard and on for controllers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed the weapon wheel getting stuck on screen when using the ping function.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed the weapon wheel getting stuck after clicking on it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed the Flying Razors Intel description, which previously made it look like the Intel got worse at higher ranks. The displayed percentage will now correctly increase with each rank.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed Small Lava Golems ignoring Retro Sam’s decoy clone after upgrading it with the Luring Intel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed several spots where standing on certain decorations could cause enemies to completely ignore the player. Nice try.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed weapons sometimes failing to spawn alongside the weapon chest in Clockwork Arena.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stability & Other Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed a possible crash when defeating Rogue Netricsa in solo mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed unnecessary empty achievement updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And we’re not stopping here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The team is also digging through your feedback and working on a larger balance update coming soon, with more adjustments based on what we’ve been seeing from players since launch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep the feedback coming. We’re reading it, discussing it, and using it to keep making Shatterverse better.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now get back out there and keep breaking the multiverse!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
